<title>USA: St Joseph hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said compared with Thursday, barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower. Top $57.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>   US 1-3    230-270 lbs	56.50-57.00</p>
<p>   US 2-3    270-290 lbs	55.00-56.00</p>
<p>Sows:  No recent comparison.</p>
<p>   US 1-2    300-500 lbs	48.00</p>
<p>   US 1-3    500-550 lbs	49.00</p>
<p>		 550-700 lbs	50.00-51.00</p>
<p>Boars:	 300-700 lbs	40.00</p>
<p>		 200-300 lbs	41.00</p>
</text>
